    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i woke up this morning and my whole left side of my face just feels weird. like the corner of my mouth is drooping and i cant really close my eye all the way on that side. i dont feel any pain or anything just kinda numb/weak. is this like bells palsy or should i be worried about a stroke??",
