      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that but i dont have any other symptoms like i can talk fine and i dont have any headache or weakness in my arm or anything. it really just feels like a facial muscle thing. u think it's possible it's just bells palsy and i can just wait a day or two to see if it gets better on its own?",
